Conclusion

The goal model presented above decomposes the mission into clear intentional objectives and concrete tasks. The sequential branch (G2 and G3) handles a single resource, while the parallel branch (G5) leverages multiple robots for concurrent execution when multiple items are required. All tasks and goals include runtime annotations and relational justifications based on the mission description.

